window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The girl I used to be is gone, snuffed out by their deceit—with the swift snap that tore my world apart.</b></p> <p>Titus thought he had vengeance to serve before? He hasn't seen anything yet.</p> <p>I may still be reeling from the lies and deception, but I'll fight tooth and nail to avenge my sister and get back to my mates.</p> <p>These gods don't know what they've just done—their treachery has awoken an ancient power in me, one that won't be sated until their bones are mere piles of dust.</p> <p>I'm done fending off their attacks, because now I'm the predator. I'll pretend to play their game, but with the revelations I've made and the new allies on my side, I'm the one calling the shots.</p> <p>I am a light god, a dark god—and I am death incarnate.</p> <p>Revelation <i>is book three of four in The Ethereal Gods series. It is a paranormal reverse harem romance. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
